# AyurStock Pro UI/UX Overhaul Plan

This plan aims to dramatically improve the UI/UX by converting the existing design to a modern SaaS-style interface. We will focus on the color palette, typography, removing dummy data, fixing non-functional buttons, and redesigning the Dashboard and Settings pages.

## User Review Required

> [!CAUTION]
> The Dashboard and Settings pages will undergo significant structural changes. We will be removing the hardcoded `mockSalesData` and replacing it with real dynamic data. If the backend endpoints for these don't exist yet, we can build simple placeholders that fetch real data structures. 

## Proposed Changes

### Global Design System & Layout
- **Colors & Typography:** We will update [tailwind.config.js](file:///c:/Users/vaibh/Documents/Ayur-stock%20pro/tailwind.config.js) to utilize a professional medical/SaaS color palette. We will use `Inter` or `Roboto` via `next/font/google` in [app/layout.tsx](file:///c:/Users/vaibh/Documents/Ayur-stock%20pro/app/layout.tsx).
- **Global Layout:** We will ensure [app/layout.tsx](file:///c:/Users/vaibh/Documents/Ayur-stock%20pro/app/layout.tsx) and the `dashboard/layout.tsx` use modern spacing, glassmorphism or clean borders, and responsive sidebars.

#### [MODIFY] [tailwind.config.js](file:///c:/Users/vaibh/Documents/Ayur-stock%20pro/tailwind.config.js)
- Redefine `primary`, `secondary`, `accent`, and `background` colors. Add standard Tailwind typography and shadow updates.
#### [MODIFY] [layout.tsx](file:///c:/Users/vaibh/Documents/Ayur-stock%20pro/app/layout.tsx)
- Add Google Fonts integration and apply it globally.

---

### Dashboard Enhancement
- **Data:** Replace `mockSalesData` in [app/dashboard/page.tsx](file:///c:/Users/vaibh/Documents/Ayur-stock%20pro/app/dashboard/page.tsx) with real API calls using the existing `@tanstack/react-query` or server actions. Add empty states if there is no sales data.
- **UI:** Upgrade the [StatCard](file:///c:/Users/vaibh/Documents/Ayur-stock%20pro/app/dashboard/page.tsx#87-101) components to modern styling with subtle micro-animations. Refine `AlertsPanel` for clear hierarchy. Add better spacing.
#### [MODIFY] [page.tsx (Dashboard)](file:///c:/Users/vaibh/Documents/Ayur-stock%20pro/app/dashboard/page.tsx)

---

### Settings Restructure
- The current settings page uses tabs for everything. We will improve this by redesigning [app/dashboard/settings/page.tsx](file:///c:/Users/vaibh/Documents/Ayur-stock%20pro/app/dashboard/settings/page.tsx) into a more modern layout (e.g. vertical sidebar or improved card layouts) with clear sections (Profile, Shop Info, Billing, Preferences).
#### [MODIFY] [page.tsx (Settings)](file:///c:/Users/vaibh/Documents/Ayur-stock%20pro/app/dashboard/settings/page.tsx)

---

### Removing Dummy Data & Non-Functional Elements
- We will audit dashboard components and `seed.ts` (if relevant) to remove any pre-filled fake data and introduce clean empty states. We will also hook up or remove dead buttons (e.g. "Add Inventory" button on the Dashboard).

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
1. **Build Check:** Run `npm run build` to ensure the Next.js build passes without TypeScript or linting errors.

### Manual Verification
1. Please start the development server using `npm run dev`.
2. Visually inspect the Dashboard for the new clean aesthetic, checking that no dummy text is visible and empty states are displayed where appropriate.
3. Test layout responsiveness on mobile (using browser DevTools).
4. Navigate to the Settings page to ensure the restructured layout feels intuitive and forms submit successfully.
